# Backend conventions

- Keep business status transitions in services, not in route handlers.
- API and cron must reuse the same redeem/auto-close logic.
- Promocodes are exactly 8 digits.
- Use SQLAlchemy models under `backend/app/models/`.
- Alembic migrations live in `backend/alembic/versions/`.
- Database URL uses `postgresql+psycopg://...`.
- Local Postgres default: `localhost:5433`.
- Write checker logs for scans and closes.
- Admin edits must go through audited services, never silent raw updates.
